<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: an operation of this kind is already underway -->
  <FFF_TimedSite_AlreadyActive>已有一項同類行動正在進行中</FFF_TimedSite_AlreadyActive>
  <!-- EN: Unable to locate a target: no valid site could be found on the world map. -->
  <FFF_TimedSite_CannotFindSite>無法定位目標：在世界地圖上找不到合適的地點。</FFF_TimedSite_CannotFindSite>

  <!-- EN: Target site lost -->
  <FFF_TimedSite_ExpiredLabel>目標站點已失去蹤跡</FFF_TimedSite_ExpiredLabel>
  <!-- EN: The window of opportunity has closed. The target site has relocated and its position is lost. -->
  <FFF_TimedSite_ExpiredText>行動窗口已經關閉。目標站點已轉移陣地，位置就此失去蹤跡。</FFF_TimedSite_ExpiredText>

  <!-- EN: Site secured -->
  <FFF_TimedSite_ClearedLabel>站點已肅清</FFF_TimedSite_ClearedLabel>
  <!-- EN: All hostiles at the site have been neutralized. Whatever remains on-site is yours to claim. -->
  <FFF_TimedSite_ClearedText>站點內的敵人已全數殲滅。站內剩餘的一切現在任你取用。</FFF_TimedSite_ClearedText>

  <!-- EN: Hostile site: reinforcements inbound -->
  <FFF_TimedSite_EntryCountdownLabel>敵對站點：增援即將抵達</FFF_TimedSite_EntryCountdownLabel>
  <!-- EN: You have entered a hostile installation and your presence has been flagged.\n\nEnemy reinforcements will arrive in {0}. Finish your business and get out — or dig in. -->
  <FFF_TimedSite_EntryCountdownText>你已進入敵對設施，你的存在已被標記。\n\n敵方增援將於 {0} 後抵達。</FFF_TimedSite_EntryCountdownText>
